# Review requirements. Enable "Require review from Code Owners" in branch
# protection on `main`, or these lines request reviewers without enforcing.
#
# Teams must exist in the cloud-native-karachi organization:
#   organizers   Admin
#   members      Triage
#   sig-*        Write, scoped to that SIG's directory

* @cloud-native-karachi/organizers

# Anyone may open a pull request against these; merging needs an organizer.
/members/           @cloud-native-karachi/organizers
/governance/        @cloud-native-karachi/organizers
/events/            @cloud-native-karachi/organizers
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md @cloud-native-karachi/organizers
/.github/           @cloud-native-karachi/organizers

# Uncomment a line when that SIG goes active, so its leads own their charter and
# nothing else.
# /sigs/sig-platform/       @cloud-native-karachi/sig-platform
# /sigs/sig-observability/  @cloud-native-karachi/sig-observability
# /sigs/sig-security/       @cloud-native-karachi/sig-security
